  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cdb3c4aad0fcb53cee0c5445d7a2dad8e20bb230_0.webp\" alt=\"Jaden's Nether Expansion\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fThatJadenXgamer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/41e8a5f48e8d948883dd1ccff292ab19d9f292d2.png\" alt=\"Twitter / X\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/y9zpxHeQuC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c903b0317e14abb041077f10cec1e3c9813ed91.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fJaden-s-Nether-Expansion-5e297f08f3514b8287ebffb527f318a4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cbc419c446866c89930d3d292cad7b6fd9284ff1.png\" alt=\"JNE Wiki\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jadens-nether-expansion/files/6729020\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a9a7c91d8999f2f0addb167f97be4480d44dba8d.png\" alt=\"下載 JNE Forge 版\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2475e1dc950bd380a4814c3e8ebc3fcc45a6a61.png\" alt=\"關於\"></p><p><strong>Jaden's Nether Expansion</strong> 是一個貼近原版風格的模組，旨在擴展整個地獄維度，添加各種全新內容，並重新設計現有原版概念。此專案仍在持續成長並不斷更新，準備好迎接迄今為止最大的地獄模組吧。</p><p>它最初只是一個樸素的材質包，但已發展成一個專為 Forge 1.20.1+ 設計的完整模組。</p><p>如有任何疑問，請加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/y9zpxHeQuC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a></p><p><strong>或查閱 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fJaden-s-Nether-Expansion-5e297f08f3514b8287ebffb527f318a4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a> 以獲得模組的完整文件</strong></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fJaden-s-Nether-Expansion-5e297f08f3514b8287ebffb527f318a4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1111833/description_a992a26a-ea57-429e-8c1b-226778aaab4e.png\" alt=\"wiki\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a611311d689ba4a3725c28f29575553b27d86a7c.png\" alt=\"依賴\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elysium-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1111833/description_cd557a59-af44-44ba-91d7-6ee66c8cdc2d.png\" alt=\"Elysium API\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/603cf9280a9882bd623ee6608592e6ca439568b1.png\" alt=\"路線圖\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/79497d3bc91aaf3ca5dbf7fe44b830c7dcb23890_0.webp\" alt=\"JNE 路線圖\"></p><p>Jaden's Nether Expansion 持續更新中，目前僅完成全部內容的八分之一！我將陸續更新所有 5 個原版生態域，並新增 4 個全新生態域。</p><p>每個生態域都將擁有獨特的方塊、物品、生物、遊戲機制等更多內容！</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/11590b90cdf1650895af7e600a040cf17b2198ac.png\" alt=\"致謝\"></p><h3>貢獻者：</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fBon_Exists\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ceasingbonsai17</a> - 貢獻了螢光菇、光孢子和多項模組相容材質</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCH2eK7HVNIQZpDlGS9Ton3g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alganaut</a> - 製作了黑色流浪者材質</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fludocrypt.bandcamp.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LudoCrypt</a> - 創作了蟋蟀唱片</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Faithful</a> - 像素一致的岩漿立方怪材質取自 Faithful 32x 與 64x</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Wawwior/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wawwior</a> - 協助修復了一些錯誤與問題</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fSydokiddo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sydokiddo</a> - 建議了「靈魂板岩」的名稱</p><h3>翻譯者：</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjuliusportfolio.carrd.co%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Julius</a> - 巴西葡萄牙文 [pt_br]</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/0Starocean0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">0Starocean0</a> - 簡體中文 [zh_cn]</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252foctagintaa%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">octaginta</a> - 土耳其文 [tr_tr]</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@sir_color\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SirColor</a> - 西班牙文 [es_es]</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Wawwior/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wawwior</a> 與 ThatJadenXgamer - 德文 [de_de]</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/AlexeyR2D2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AlexeyR2D2</a> 與 Linor - 俄文 [ru_ru]</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/AleXandr22/favorites\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sandro</a> - 義大利文 [it_it]</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/unroman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">unroman</a> - 烏克蘭文 [uk_ua]</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Tamakii-2005\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EtherealTams</a> - 阿根廷西班牙文 [es_ar]</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/TheDarkWatchernether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TheDarkWatcher</a> - 波蘭文 [pl_pl]</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/sunbatheproductions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">sunbatheproductions</a> - 日文 [jp_jp]</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3f5988a82c3d6604b6b28d775158ccbdce9150a2.png\" alt=\"常見問題\"></p><p><strong>問：Jaden's Nether Expansion 仍然是資料包/資源包嗎？</strong></p><p>答：不，JNE 已完全重製為 Forge/NeoForge 的正式模組。</p><p><strong>問：何時會更新到 X Minecraft 版本？</strong></p><p>答：最終會更新，但目前沒有確切時間。</p><p><strong>問：會向下移植嗎？</strong></p><p>答：不會。</p><p><strong>問：為什麼停止了 Fabric 版本的開發？</strong></p><p>答：在兩個模組載具上管理像 JNE 這麼龐大的專案變得過於吃力。而且 Fabric API 本身功能不足，嚴重限制了這個模組的發展。未來 JNE 將僅支援 Forge/NeoForge。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>",
